# 6️⃣ Modified Dijkstra

Maintain:

```cpp
dist[]
```

and

```cpp
ways[]
```

---

### Rules

If shorter path found:

```cpp
ways[v] = ways[u];
```

---

If same shortest path found:

```cpp
ways[v] += ways[u];
```

