# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Alien Dictionary = Topological Sort.

✅ SCC = Kosaraju Algorithm.

✅ Bridges use Tin & Low arrays.

✅ Articulation Points use same Tin-Low concept.

✅ Path With Minimum Effort = Modified Dijkstra.

