# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Forgetting graph reversal in Kosaraju.

❌ Wrong bridge condition.

❌ Wrong articulation root condition.

❌ Using BFS for weighted shortest path.

❌ Forgetting ways[] update in modified Dijkstra.

